  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThe Golden Dusk recipe transforms your image into a world of warmth and nostalgia. Designed to evoke a cozy ambiance reminiscent of a warm autumn sunset, it highlights vibrant yellow and orange hues, infusing your photos with high saturation, and low contrast, enhancing the white tonal expressions. Perfect for creating a welcoming atmosphere, this recipe is ideal for landscapes, portraits, and urban scenes, enhancing their allure with a soft, vibrant glow.\n\nWhether bathed in the golden light of sunrise or sunset or captured amidst colorful surroundings, this recipe is designed for shooting conditions where warm light prevails. Thriving during the golden hour, this recipe envelopes your images in a captivating wave of golden light.\n",
